Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.00,0:06:44.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《007系列之雷霆谷》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.92,0:00:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫控制中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calling Cape Com. Cape Com.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.21,0:00:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是木星16号 可以进入第四号轨道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Jupiter 16. Can you give a go for fourth orbit?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.22,0:00:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制中心回答木星16号 可否证实氧气压力在范围内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cape Com to Jupiter 16. Confirm 02 pressure is within limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.05,0:01:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 环境控制系统一切良好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger. It all looks good in the environmental control system.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.97,0:01:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 从这里看来一切良好 可以进入第四号轨道\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. Everything looks good from here. You have a go for fourth orbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.31,0:01:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,木星16号 收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jupiter 16. Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.44,0:01:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已准备好太空漫步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stowing all loose gear, ready for the EVA.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.15,0:01:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,木星16号 准备好就开始太空漫步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jupiter 16, this is Cape Com. Start your EVA any time you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.82,0:01:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已练习过很多次太空漫步了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have time in the other EVAs for experiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.66,0:01:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以别停留太久 克里斯 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So don't stay out too long, Chris. - OK, flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.16,0:01:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别担心 我们会依计划行事 - 收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't worry. We'll stick to plan. - Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.37,0:01:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制中心呼叫木星16号 开始倒数 我的仪器读数是437\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cape Com to Jupiter 16. On my mark it will be four plus three seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.13,0:01:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,四 三 二 一 开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four, three, two, one, mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.02,0:01:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制中心 我是克里斯 我已走出太空船 一切良好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cape Com, this is Chris. I'm out. Everything looks OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.44,0:01:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.90,0:01:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,手动装置这次并没有失灵 我利用它出舱外 这次容易多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The maneuvering unit is working this time. It makes things a lot easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.11,0:02:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制中心呼叫夏威夷 这里是控制中心 请回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cape Com to Hawaii. This is flight control. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.32,0:02:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏威夷 收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hawaii, roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.03,0:02:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏威夷 这次太空漫步 将会在你们基地的上空进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hawaii, we expect to start EVA over your station on this pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.95,0:02:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏威夷呼叫木星16号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hawaii to Jupiter 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.62,0:02:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个不明物体从船尾快速接近你 你看到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is an unidentified object closing on you fast from astern. Can you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.17,0:02:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏威夷 我们看不到 让我们查查太空船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hawaii, we have nothing here. Hold while we check the space track.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.88,0:02:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏威夷呼叫木星16号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hawaii to Jupiter 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.59,0:02:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复 夏威夷呼叫木星16号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeat, Hawaii to Jupiter 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.01,0:02:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我们的观测器看到 有个不明物体快速接近\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is an unidentified object on our scope closing fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.23,0:02:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不到任何东西 你能给我方位吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We see nothing. Can you give me a bearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.23,0:02:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,它从船尾快速的接近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Appears to be coming up fast from astern.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.98,0:02:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, now I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.19,0:02:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是另一艘太空船 重复 是另一艘太空船\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's another spacecraft. Repeat, it's another spacecraft!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.12,0:02:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它看来像只是经过吗？- 你的电讯断断续续 再说一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Does it look like a close pass? - You're breaking up. Say again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.37,0:02:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它看来像只是经过吗？- 克里斯 发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Does it look like a close pass? - Chris, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.67,0:02:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,它向著我们飞来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming right at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.92,0:02:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的前端打开了 重复 它的前端打开了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The front is opening up. I repeat, the front is opening up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.96,0:03:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它向著我们飞来 - 快回去船舱里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's coming right at us. - Chris, get back in. Get back in!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.64,0:03:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听得到我吗？你的电讯断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you read me? You're breaking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.35,0:03:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯 发生什么事了？怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chris, what's happening? What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.97,0:03:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏威夷呼叫木星16号 听到吗？请回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hawaii to Jupiter 16. Hawaii to Jupiter 16. Are you receiving me? Come in, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.58,0:03:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的生命线断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lead line! It's…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.20,0:03:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏威夷呼叫木星16号 夏威夷呼叫木星16号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hawaii to Jupiter 16. Hawaii to Jupiter 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.83,0:03:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你接收得到吗？请回答 通话完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you receiving me? Come in, please. Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.17,0:03:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,休士顿？无线电通讯中断了 在观测器上也找不到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Houston? We've lost radio contact. We've also lost him on the scope.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.72,0:03:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不明物体还在轨道上 通知所有基地密切追踪它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unidentified object is still orbiting. Alert all stations and track him closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.11,0:03:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,太可笑了 苏联政府竟然否认这件事跟他们有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is ridiculous for the Soviet government to deny responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.86,0:04:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏联政府否认知道此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Soviet government denies all knowledge of this affair.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.49,0:04:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,全世界都知道 我国是爱好和平的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world knows we are a peace-loving people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.28,0:04:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此我通知各位二十天后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hereby give notice that in 20 days' time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.24,0:04:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国打算发射另一艘太空船\N{\fnArial\fs30}the United States will launch her next spaceship into orbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.62,0:04:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我国政府吩咐我来通知各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am instructed to inform you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.71,0:04:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何妨碍这艘太空船的行动 将会被视为战争行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}that any interference with it will be regarded as an act of war.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.92,0:04:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想请问有任何动机使得我们的俄国朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I ask what motive our Russian friends would have.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.47,0:04:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望毁灭美国的太空船\N{\fnArial\fs30}for wishing to destroy American spacecraft?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.09,0:04:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我国政府认为这是很明显的企图\N{\fnArial\fs30}My government sees this as nothing less than a blatant attempt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.47,0:04:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了军事目的而想完全控制太空\N{\fnArial\fs30}to gain complete and absolute control of space itself for military purposes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.14,0:04:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.06,0:04:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国政府不认为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her Majesty's Government is not convinced.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.81,0:04:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那艘飞船来自苏联政府\N{\fnArial\fs30}that this intruder missile originated from Soviet Russia.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.53,0:04:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,新加坡的雷达观测站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our tracking station in Singapore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.61,0:04:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,探测到在日本海附近收到太空船的微弱回响\N{\fnArial\fs30}reported faint echoes of this craft coming down in the Sea of Japan area.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.12,0:04:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议各位把情报力量集中在该地区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might I suggest this is where you should concentrate your intelligence forces?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.58,0:04:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,首相要我向各位保证我们也打算这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}The prime minister assures you that this is what we propose to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.42,0:05:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 我们的情报员已在香港展开行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a matter of fact, our man in Hong Kong is working on it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.43,0:05:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么中国女孩尝起来 会与众不同？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do Chinese girls taste different from all other girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.14,0:05:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为我们比较好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think we better, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.31,0:05:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 就是不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, just different.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.44,0:05:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像北京烤鸭跟俄式鱼子酱不同 但我两者都爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Peking duck is different from Russian caviar, but I love 'em both.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.57,0:05:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我提供给你最好的鸭 - 那真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Darling, I give you very best duck. - That would be lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.28,0:05:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们共度了愉快的时光 我真的舍不得走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've had some interesting times together, Ling. I'll be sorry to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.68,0:05:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,守着门口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.47,0:05:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那张床\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.32,0:06:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们来晚了 - 至少他是因工殉职\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're too late. - Well, at least he died on the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.03,0:06:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定想死于此因\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd have wanted it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.93,0:09:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那眼睛闪烁的瞬间\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We shall not all sleep, but we shall all be changed,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.43,0:09:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,在最后的号角声中\N{\fnArial\fs30}"in a moment, in the twinkling of an eye, at the last trump."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.27,0:09:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,当号角响起 死者将是圣洁的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"For the trumpet shall sound and the dead shall be raised incorruptible,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.90,0:09:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都会改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}"and we shall all be changed."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.98,0:09:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此把他的躯体交托给大海\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We therefore commit his body to the deep to be turned into corruption,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.78,0:09:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,在大海释放他的时候 得到再生\N{\fnArial\fs30}"looking for the resurrection of the body when the sea shall give up her dead."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.24,0:09:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,立正\N{\fnArial\fs30}Present!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.58,0:09:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸣枪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.46,0:09:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸣枪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.59,0:09:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸣枪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.91,0:11:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打开 - 是的 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carry on. - Aye aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.02,0:11:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请求允许登船 - 允许登船 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Request permission to come aboard, sir. - Permission granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.15,0:11:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 带这名军官出去 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take this officer aft. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.74,0:11:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一号 带她去045\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number One, take her up to 90 feet. Course 045.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.16,0:11:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.54,0:11:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 班霓 - 你最好马上进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello, Penny. - You'd better go right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.50,0:11:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又迟到了 从你自己的丧礼来也迟到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're late as usual. Even from your own funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.25,0:12:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们死人是没有时间观念的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We corpses have no sense of timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.22,0:12:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可以进去了 先生 - 谢谢你 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In you go… sir. - Thank you… ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.52,0:12:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请坐 007 - 谢谢长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, sit down, 007. - Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.65,0:12:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有副作用吧？- 一点都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No ill effects? - None at all, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.03,0:12:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在已死了 或许你的一些老朋友会暂时不太注意你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're dead, perhaps some of your old friends will pay less attention to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.24,0:12:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你有多一点活动空间 你会需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give you more elbow room. You'll need it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.91,0:12:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事很严重 这也是我亲自来的原因 我想你已得到简报\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the big one. That's why I'm out here myself. I take it you're fully briefed?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.58,0:12:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我有一件事不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir. But there's one thing I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.59,0:12:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果在新加坡的 雷达观测站没错…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If our tracking station is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.80,0:12:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,查知火箭没有降落在俄国 那它会降落在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}about the rocket not landing in Russia, then where did it land?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.13,0:12:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们估计是在日本\N{\fnArial\fs30}We assume it's Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.93,0:12:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,提醒你 这只是猜测 但首相要我们全力调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is pure guesswork, but the PM wants us to play it with everything we've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.18,0:12:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有做空中侦察吗？- 每一处都拍了照但没发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And the aerial reconnaissance? - Every inch photographed. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.02,0:12:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,日本有能力发射这样的火箭吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are the Japanese equipped to launch such a rocket?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.06,0:13:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不认为他们有 - 那谁能够呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We don't think so. - Then who else is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.32,0:13:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要在战争爆发前尽快找出是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you've got to find out. And fast, before the real shooting starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.82,0:13:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事有可能导致全面战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}This damn thing could blow up into a full-scale war.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.62,0:13:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,到达东京后 到这个地址找此人\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you get to Tokyo, go to that name and address.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.54,0:13:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们的人员汉德森会跟你联络 - 汉德森\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Our man Henderson will contact you. - Henderson.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.75,0:13:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 长官 我们正全速前进 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Captain here, sir. We're under way. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.88,0:13:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没别的了 - 谢谢长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's all. - Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.34,0:13:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 007？- 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 007? - Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.97,0:13:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们离美国发射另一艘太空船 只有三星期的时间 你知道吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've only three weeks till the Americans launch the next one. You know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.35,0:13:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,情报说苏联太空船会更早发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my sources tell me the Russians are planning one even earlier than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.60,0:13:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 因此要尽快行动 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So move fast, 007. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.40,0:13:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个女孩如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, by the way, how was the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.99,0:13:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪个女孩？- 我们替你安排的中国女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which girl? - The Chinese one we fixed you up with.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.99,0:13:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再过五分钟我便可知道 - 她不知道她错过了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Another five minutes, I'd have found out. - Hm. She'll never know what she missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.92,0:14:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱班霓小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Moneypenny?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.29,0:14:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,把日本情报局的暗号告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give 007 the password we've agreed with Japanese SIS.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.46,0:14:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.13,0:14:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们设法想一个你不会忘记的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We tried to think of something that you wouldn't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.51,0:14:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.68,0:14:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I love you."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.64,0:14:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你重复一次 以免你不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeat it, please, to make sure you get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.02,0:14:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心 我知道 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, I get it. Sayonara.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.65,0:14:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}James? Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.40,0:14:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,日语速成 你可能需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instant Japanese. You may need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.99,0:14:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘了我在剑桥的东方语言科拿第一名\N{\fnArial\fs30}You forget, I took a first in oriental languages at Cambridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.58,0:14:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备装上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by to load.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.21,0:14:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lift to the launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.14,0:14:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.79,0:16:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的门票\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.75,0:16:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.18,0:18:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.81,0:18:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的车就在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a car nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.77,0:18:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你建议我们去哪里？- 我知道有一间僻静的旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh? Where do you suggest we go? - I know a quiet hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.74,0:18:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后呢？- 你的朋友在哪里等你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And? - Where your friend is waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.28,0:18:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉德森先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Henderson.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.25,0:18:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他无法亲自来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't Mr. Henderson able to come himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.67,0:18:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想不能 - 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I suppose not. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.50,0:18:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.94,0:19:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,该去旅馆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think it's about hotel-time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.63,0:19:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮汉德森工作多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have you been working for Henderson?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.09,0:19:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,久到知道不该跟陌生人讨论此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long enough to learn not to discuss such matters with strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.95,0:20:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 汉德森先生在等你 - 你不跟我一起进去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Henderson's waiting for you. - You're not coming in with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.79,0:20:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉德森先生想单独见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Henderson would like to see you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.80,0:20:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.47,0:20:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是汉德森先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Henderson?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.02,0:20:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,在下正是\N{\fnArial\fs30}At your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.78,0:20:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你想问我一些问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you wanted to ask me some questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.29,0:20:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 请原谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.84,0:21:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 幸好你没敲错腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - I'm glad you got it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.34,0:21:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,1942年我在新加坡失掉那条腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost that in Singapore in '42.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.26,0:21:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,请原谅我这种混合式的装潢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you must excuse this rather odd mixture of styles,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.18,0:21:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想变得完全日本化\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I refuse to go entirely Japanese.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.31,0:21:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很喜欢这些古董\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very fond of some of these old things.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.69,0:21:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没有来过日本？- 从没有过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've never been to Japan before? - No, never.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.57,0:21:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经在这里居住了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I myself have lived here for, er…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.15,0:21:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十八年 现在才开始熟悉环境\N{\fnArial\fs30}28 years. And I'm just beginning to know my way about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.12,0:21:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你最重要的联络人是田中 - 田中？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your most vital contact will be Tanaka. - Tanaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.08,0:21:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是日本情报局的主管\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's head of the Japanese secret service.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.75,0:21:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的身分是日本的最高机密\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his identity is the most closely guarded secret in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.17,0:21:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么时候可以见他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When can I see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.21,0:21:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你今晚就可以见老虎 - 老虎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can see Tiger tonight. - "Tiger?"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.42,0:21:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的好朋友是这样称呼他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}His closest friends are permitted to call him that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.84,0:21:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你自己有线索吗？- 我有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you have any leads of your own? - Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.56,0:21:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是搅拌的 不是摇的 你喜欢这样 是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's stirred, not shaken. That was right, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.73,0:21:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 干杯 干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect. Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.15,0:22:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄国的伏特加酒 非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Russian vodka. Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.32,0:22:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄国大使馆的警卫给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it from the doorman at the Russian embassy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.94,0:22:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然还有其他东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amongst certain other things.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.24,0:22:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.28,0:22:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦敦方面的推论是正确的 飞弹是由这里发射的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think London's theory about the missile being fired from this country is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.91,0:22:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道地点和方法 也不知道是谁做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how or where, and don't ask me who's doing it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.63,0:22:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我有预感… 幕后有外国势力在操纵\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, er… I have a fairly shrewd idea that a major foreign power is behind it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.01,0:22:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄国和日本以外的势力？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean apart from Russia and Japan?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.30,0:22:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定不是俄国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's not Russia, old boy. I'm sure of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.14,0:22:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是日本\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not Japan either.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.31,0:22:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然有一间日本的大企业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although a large Japanese industrial concern is…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.01,0:24:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.94,0:26:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.23,0:26:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,伏特加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Siamese vodka?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.52,0:28:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.65,0:28:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是怎么一回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what the hell's the score?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.82,0:28:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？我是来帮助你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean? My job is to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.62,0:28:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就像你帮助汉德森一样？- 我要带你去一个安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like you helped Henderson? - I'm taking you to a place of safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.08,0:28:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这次换我来带你 我要知道一些资料 现在就要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, this time I'm taking you. I want some information now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.50,0:28:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没有资料给你 - 待会就知道 慢一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have no information to give you. - We'll soon see about that. Slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.97,0:29:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.23,0:29:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到日本 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Japan, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.77,0:29:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴终于跟你见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a great pleasure to meet you at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.61,0:29:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前为止 你对我们国家的印象如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how do you like our country so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.82,0:29:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有点失望 这么容易就能引你来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a trifle disappointed at the ease with which I could pull you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.00,0:29:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久以前 我母亲就告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one thing my honorable mother taught me long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.83,0:29:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万别坐上陌生女子的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}was never to get into a car with a strange girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.71,0:30:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你会跟女人做任何事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you, I'm afraid, will get into anything with any girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.09,0:30:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,对一个死人来说 你倒生龙活虎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must say, you have a lot of energy for a dead man, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.64,0:30:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是詹姆斯邦德吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are James Bond, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.94,0:30:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴认识你 我真的很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so very pleased to meet you, Bond-san. I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.57,0:30:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,请容我自我介绍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Permit me to introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.82,0:30:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是田中 请叫我老虎\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Tanaka. Please call me Tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.29,0:30:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你是田中 那你对我感觉如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're Tanaka, how do you feel about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.50,0:30:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.88,0:30:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴能弄清楚你的身分\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad we got that out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.71,0:30:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你能尽快检验这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like you to examine these as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.92,0:30:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是从大里的保险箱取出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're from Osato's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.22,0:30:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,海军商店的订货单 五百公斤牛油 五十桶熏咸鲑鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is an order for naval stores. 500 kilos of butter, 50 containers of lox.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.40,0:31:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么？- 是美国的腌鲑鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is lox? - An American name for smoked salmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.32,0:31:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也是液态氧的名字 可以用作火箭燃料\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's also the technical name for liquid oxygen, which makes rocket fuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.70,0:31:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 非常有趣 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Very interesting. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.62,0:31:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.62,0:31:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去比进来时庄重多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The journey out will be more dignified than the journey in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.83,0:31:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一点都不困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wouldn't be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.04,0:31:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想放大那张底片 - 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'd like that negative enlarged. All right? - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.22,0:31:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的私人火车 我从不在东京街上走\N{\fnArial\fs30}My private train. I never travel in the streets of Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.60,0:31:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,以我的地位 这样是很不智的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my position, it would be most unwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.44,0:31:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常方便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.19,0:31:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信M在伦敦也是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I imagine that your Mr. M in London has a similar arrangement.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.15,0:31:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,M？是的 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}M? Oh, yes, but of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.74,0:31:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,开白色跑车的女子是我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the girl in the white sports car's one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.41,0:31:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明子？是 - 她非常能干\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aki? Yes. - Very competent.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.20,0:31:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢日本清酒吗 还是伏特加马汀尼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you like Japanese sake, Mr. Bond, or would you prefer vodka martini?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.12,0:32:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢清酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, I like sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.00,0:32:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是温度适中的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially when it's served at the correct temperature.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.30,0:32:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,华氏98.4度 就像现在这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}98.4?Fahrenheit, like this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.51,0:32:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,以欧洲人来说 你非常讲究\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a European, you are exceptionally cultivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.93,0:32:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们来看你发现的照片 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll see the photograph you found. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.06,0:32:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,一条船跟一片地 有可能是任何地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a ship and a strip of land. It could be anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.90,0:32:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的手下在照片中发现一个微粒 放大！\N{\fnArial\fs30}My men found a microdot on the paper. Enlarge!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.15,0:32:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,它说：「美国女游客…从船上拍到的」\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says, "Photograph taken by female American tourist from coastal vessel."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.74,0:32:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,「作为一般的防范 她给杀害了」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The woman has been liquidated as a routine precaution."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.99,0:32:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能再看一次吗？- 当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can we see the photograph again? - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.46,0:32:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们因为一张照片 而杀了一个无辜的游客\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they killed an innocent tourist for taking this?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.63,0:32:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,能再放大点吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you make it bigger?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.17,0:32:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,宁波\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ning-Po.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.42,0:32:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,查查宁波号的详尽资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check motor vessel Ning-Po. Full details.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.30,0:32:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,它最近的行踪及目前的地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}All recent movements and present whereabouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.68,0:33:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 左边的是什么？- 集中在左边\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that on the left? - Focus on the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.06,0:33:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,潜水女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aha. Ama. Diving girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.94,0:33:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能认出该海岸吗？- 有时间便可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you identify that coastline? - Given time, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.78,0:33:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁是大里化工的首脑 - 大里先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is the head of Osato Chemicals? - Mr. Osato.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.99,0:33:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可否替我安排明天见他？- 可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you arrange a meeting tomorrow? - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.66,0:33:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但今晚把这儿当作自个儿家 包括我的财产\N{\fnArial\fs30}But tonight, consider my house yours. Including all of my possessions, naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.84,0:33:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在来洗一个文明浴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend, now you take your first civilized bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.01,0:33:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？我喜欢这里的水管装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Well, I like the plumbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.68,0:33:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把自己交给她们就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place yourself entirely in their hands, my dear Bond-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.18,0:33:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rule number one…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.23,0:33:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人可代劳时 千万别亲自动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}is never do anything for yourself when someone else can do it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.36,0:33:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 第二呢？- 第二规则…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And number two? - Rule number two…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.74,0:33:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在日本 一切以男人为先 女人次之\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Japan, men always come first. Women come second.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.99,0:33:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能会在这儿退休\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might just retire to here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.41,0:34:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国女人可永远不会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your English girls would never perform this simple service.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.46,0:34:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识有一两个会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I know one or two who might get round to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.21,0:34:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是钱班霓小姐吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Moneypenny, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.59,0:34:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们和你们一样也有情报的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have our sources, Bond-san, just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.38,0:34:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别把肥皂弄进我眼里好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get the soap in my eye, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.73,0:34:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你有什么令她们著迷吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what it is about you that fascinates them?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.61,0:34:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你的胸毛 日本男人全都皮光肉滑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the hair on your chest. Japanese men all have beautiful bare skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.40,0:34:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,日本的谚语说：「鸟儿不在秃树上筑巢」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Japanese proverb say, "Bird never make nest in bare tree."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.08,0:34:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,若汉德森的理论正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Henderson's theory is right,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.29,0:34:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,外国势力为何在日本发射飞弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}why would a foreign power want to launch missiles from Japan?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.00,0:34:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为若被人发现 他们可否认一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if ever they were discovered, they could deny responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.71,0:34:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是私人组织做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially if some private organization's doing the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.01,0:35:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大里？- 有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Osato? - Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.18,0:35:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,大里是日本的大企业家之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Osato is one of the greatest industrialists in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.64,0:35:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他只是用来掩护的 - 谁有这势力？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, he's merely a front. - Who is big enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.64,0:35:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 魔鬼党 - 有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- SPECTER. - Could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.56,0:35:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,按摩时间到 你选哪一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, massage. Which girl do you select?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.28,0:35:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我选这位老太太吧 - 好选择 她非常性感\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll just settle for this little old lady here. - Good choice. She's very sexyful.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.17,0:35:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次我是在香港被按摩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last time someone gave me a massage was in Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.71,0:35:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜要中途停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}But unfortunately we had to cut it short.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.55,0:35:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,被几个无礼的枪手打扰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were rudely interrupted by a couple of gunmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.76,0:35:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此无法完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we never got around to finishing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.06,0:35:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我们可以完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}This time, you shall finish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.40,0:35:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,明子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aki.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.91,0:36:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚没人会骚扰你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one will disturb you tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.79,0:36:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴能在你底下替你服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I will enjoy very much serving under you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.32,0:36:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 费雪先生 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Fisher? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.82,0:36:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请往这边走 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This way, please. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.62,0:36:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进 费雪先生 大里先生马上就到 请你稍等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please come in, Mr. Fisher. Mr. Osato is expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.75,0:36:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.29,0:36:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来早了三分半钟 请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are 3? minutes early. Please be seated.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.76,0:38:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 费雪先生 - 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you do, Mr. Fisher? - How do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.84,0:38:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是布兰特小姐 是我的私人秘书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Brandt, my confidential secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.76,0:38:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. - Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.56,0:38:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要喝杯香槟吗？- 不 谢谢 太早了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- May we offer you some champagne? - No, thank you. It's too early for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.64,0:38:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确定？- 我确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're quite sure? - Quite sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.48,0:38:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是在早上喝一杯 你应该试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always take a glass in the morning. You should try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.98,0:38:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对肝不好 不是吗？- 胡说 能让你整天都有活力\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's bad for your liver, isn't it? - Nonsense. It adds a sparkle to the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.07,0:38:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.29,0:39:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,费雪先生 59年的酒 你确定不来一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Dom Pignon '59, Mr. Fisher. Are you really sure you won't change your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.79,0:39:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 既然你坚持 - 请坐 费雪先生 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, if you insist. - Please be seated, Mr. Fisher.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.47,0:39:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是帝国化工新来的董事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you are the new managing director of Empire Chemicals?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.68,0:39:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那威廉森呢？- 威廉森\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened to Williamson? - Williamson?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.44,0:39:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 他是突然死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, yes. He died rather suddenly, poor chap.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.23,0:39:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么原因？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, so. From what?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.27,0:39:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在工作时跌进了粉碎机 - 哦 原来啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He fell into a pulverizer at the works. - Ah, so.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.61,0:39:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,多可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}How shocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.53,0:39:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很光荣的 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A very honorable death, all the same. - Very.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.20,0:39:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在公司很受到敬重\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gained great face with the company.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.62,0:39:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你不要冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you are not taking any risks yourself, Mr. Fisher.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.29,0:39:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我从不冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? I never take any risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.84,0:39:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你原谅我这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You forgive me for saying so, but, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.76,0:39:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为你现在就在冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you are taking one now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.01,0:39:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗？- 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am? - Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.76,0:39:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该戒烟 抽烟会对你的肺造成损害\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should give up smoking. Cigarettes are very bad for your chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.22,0:39:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,大里先生非常相信这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Osato believes in a healthy chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.60,0:40:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.94,0:40:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 你得告诉我 我能为你做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, then, you must tell me what I can do for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.52,0:40:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想买大量的酵素…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're interested in the bulk-buying of fermentation chemicals.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.94,0:40:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,味精和抗坏血酸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monosodium glutamate and ascorbic acid.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.70,0:40:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你需要制造执照吗？- 是的 非常需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You'd like a license to manufacture? - Yes, very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.45,0:40:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会要求我的销售部经理 尽快为你附上估价单\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I'll have my sales manager get quotations and delivery dates for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.04,0:40:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今天晚点会在旅馆联络你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll contact you later today at your hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.67,0:40:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你住在哪间饭店？- 希尔顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which hotel are you staying at? - The Hilton.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.38,0:40:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 费雪先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, Mr. Fisher.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.30,0:40:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很高兴认识你 - 我也很高兴认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A pleasure to meet you. - A pleasure to meet you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.01,0:40:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 布兰特小姐 - 再见 费雪先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Goodbye, Miss Brandt. - Goodbye, Mr. Fisher.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.44,0:40:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.25,0:41:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,蹲下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.10,0:41:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是294 老虎请回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}294 here. Tiger, immediate.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.68,0:41:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,294请说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in, 294.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.64,0:41:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,007在我旁边 我们正被一群 开黑色轿车的枪手追杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zero-zero is with me. We are being chased by gunmen in black sedan.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.77,0:42:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向著南面的二号高速公路走 请按照以往的安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm heading south for Highway Two. Arrange usual reception, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.04,0:43:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 日本人办事的能力不错吧？- 沧海一粟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's that for Japanese efficiency? - Just a drop in the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.42,0:43:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 007？- 是 老虎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Zero-zero? - Yes, Tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.63,0:43:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,宁波号属于大里化工的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Motor vessel "Ning-Po" is owned by Osato Chemicals.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.59,0:43:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 继续说 - 它正在神户港口装货\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That fits. Go on. - Vessel at present loading in Kobe docks.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.64,0:43:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天下午五点会开往上海\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sailing for Shanghai at 5 p.m. this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.77,0:43:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,建议你立刻去神户探查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suggest you proceed Kobe immediately to look her over.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.48,0:44:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们来的及吗 - 可以 时间刚刚好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can we make it? - Yes, just.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.61,0:44:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻前往神户港口 老虎 联络M\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proceeding immediately, Kobe docks. Tiger, contact M.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.57,0:44:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,要他送小娜莉来这里 重复 小娜莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him to send Little Nellie. Repeat, Little Nellie.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.91,0:44:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,建议她父亲跟她随行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suggest she be accompanied by her father.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.91,0:44:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 非常紧急 明白吗？- 明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Most urgent. Understood? - Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.50,0:44:39.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（上海 宁波号）
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.06,0:44:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷凝的液态氧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Condensation: ice-cold. Liquid oxygen.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.22,0:45:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这里 联络田中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here. Contact Tanaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.81,0:45:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不离开你 - 不管船只开到哪里 都要盯著这艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not leaving you. - Tell him to keep that ship shadowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.32,0:45:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.11,0:46:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他去11号那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him to Number 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.79,0:47:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 叫醒他 - 你够了没\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wake him up. - Are you finished?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.12,0:47:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.21,0:47:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在宁波号上 我的舱房内\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in my cabin on the Ning-Po.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.38,0:47:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来处理他 你们出去等 关上门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave him to me now. Wait in there. And shut the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.97,0:47:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我捉到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.72,0:47:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好享受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, enjoy yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.55,0:47:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你为谁工作？- 帝国化工\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you working for? - Empire Chemicals, you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.31,0:47:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们都随身带枪的吗？- 是的 当他们出国时\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do all their people carry guns? - When they're abroad, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.90,0:47:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么在港口查探\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why were you snooping around the docks?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.19,0:47:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢船 我以前是船员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like ships and I used to be a sailor.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.78,0:47:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.12,0:47:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道这是什么吗？- 我宁愿不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you know what this is? - I'd rather not.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.16,0:47:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,美容科医生称它为皮刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plastic surgeons call it a dermatome.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.83,0:47:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们用它来割开皮肤\N{\fnArial\fs30}They use it to slice off skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.38,0:47:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你不要逼我使用它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you won't force me to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.47,0:48:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么好的女孩 在这种地方做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what's a nice girl like you doing in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.49,0:48:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有话要说 - 是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have a confession to make. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.99,0:48:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 我是个间谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I'm a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.70,0:48:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.04,0:48:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该知道 商业机密是很值钱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose you know that industrial secrets are big business?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.55,0:48:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.42,0:48:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已偷了大里制造味精的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I've stolen Osato's new process for making monosodium glutamate.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.05,0:48:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, er…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.14,0:48:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那方法价值三十万美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's worth $300, 000.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.14,0:48:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.65,0:48:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你帮我逃回东京 我会跟你平分\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll split it with you if you'll get me out of here and back to Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.07,0:48:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a nice offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.32,0:49:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如何？- 我恐怕得拒绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How about it? - I'm afraid not.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.32,0:49:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.41,0:49:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,大里会杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Osato would kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.50,0:49:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以明天就飞去欧洲\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could fly to Europe tomorrow, you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.86,0:49:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为英国而做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The things I do for England.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.92,0:49:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚在东京需要严密的保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are going to need some very close protection tonight in Tokyo,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.63,0:50:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们会来抓你\N{\fnArial\fs30}because… well, that's when they'll try and get at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.76,0:50:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你需要最好的保镖 - 你推荐谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You'll need the best man we've got. - And who do you suggest?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.89,0:50:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.39,0:50:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恐怕今晚另有约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid I have another appointment tonight, Mr. Fisher.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.73,0:50:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很舍不得离开你 但我必须要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm awfully sorry to leave you, but I have to get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.67,0:51:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已告诉过你 追女孩子会给你带来麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chasing girls will be the end of you, Bond-san. I told you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.09,0:51:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他并没有追她 他是为了让我逃走\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't chase her. He did it so I could get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.47,0:51:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他才不会碰那么可怕的女人 你不会 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wouldn't touch that horrible girl. You wouldn't, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.55,0:51:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然不会 有进展吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, heaven forbid. Any progress?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.85,0:51:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 我们已查出照片上的海岸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. We have identified the coastline in the photograph.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.89,0:51:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个叫松江的小岛 就在神户跟上海之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is an island called Matsu, on the direct route between Kobe and Shanghai.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.69,0:51:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用直升机跟踪著宁波号\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shadowed the Ning-Po in a helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.23,0:51:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它停靠在那个小岛吗？- 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did it stop at the island? - I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.19,0:51:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天晚上很暗 不太看得见它\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a very dark night. Impossible to see her all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.91,0:51:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们知道它停靠在某处 你看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we know she stopped somewhere. Look at these.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.33,0:51:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这张是我们昨晚照的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That one we took last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.75,0:51:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这张是今天早上照的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that one, early this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.46,0:52:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 注意看它的水位 - 你说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Notice, please, the water line. - You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.75,0:52:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这张装满了货 这张却是空船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fully laden here and empty here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.88,0:52:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在要去那个岛看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to take a fast look at the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.05,0:52:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小娜莉到达了没有？- 到了 她的父亲也来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Has Little Nellie arrived yet? - Yes. And her father.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.01,0:52:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎到日本 老爸 我的小娜莉准备好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Japan, Dad. Is my little girl hot and ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.27,0:52:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我飞了一段又长又累 又毫无目的旅途\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, 007, I've had a long and tiring journey, probably to no purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.35,0:52:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有心情听你这些幼稚的嘲弄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in no mood for your juvenile quips.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.75,0:52:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好奇 小娜莉是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have much curiosity, Bond-san. What is Little Nellie?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.46,0:52:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个又棒又小又快的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, she's a wonderful girl. Very small, quite fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.84,0:52:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,能为你做任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can do anything. Just your type.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.34,0:52:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一架玩具直升机 - 它绝对不是玩具 你会知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A toy helicopter? - No, it's certainly not a toy. You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.93,0:52:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从你上次用过后 我们又改进了它 我会告诉你如何使用\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made some improvements since you used her last. I'll give you the drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.81,0:53:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是给小孩子坐的 别用它 用我的直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}This can only be for children. Don't use it, Bond-san. Take my helicopter instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.03,0:53:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 现在仔细听好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Now pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.99,0:53:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 两支固定的机关枪 - 射程有多远？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Two machine guns, fixed. - Synchronized to what?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.03,0:53:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一百码 配有燃烧弹和高性能炸药\N{\fnArial\fs30}100 yards, using incendiaries and high explosives.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.95,0:53:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,两支向前发射的火箭炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two rocket launchers, forward-firing on either side.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.83,0:53:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.83,0:53:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是空对空探热导弹 一分钟六十英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, these fire heat-seeking, air-to-air missiles. 60 a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.34,0:53:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.75,0:53:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,两支向后发射的喷火枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flame guns. Two of 'em, firing astern.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.51,0:53:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 射程多远？- 八十码\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What range? - 80 yards.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.13,0:53:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,在它们旁边有两个烟雾喷射器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two smoke ejectors next door to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.72,0:53:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,航空地雷 要记得 飞在目标的正上方才能使用 就这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aerial mines. Use them only when directly above target. That's about the lot, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.31,0:53:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 剩下的你都知道了吧 - 知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know the rest, don't you? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.98,0:53:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,摄影机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cine camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.11,0:53:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 田中 收听410兆赫的频道 - 祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tanaka, listen in on 410 megacycles. - Good luck, Bond-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.11,0:53:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我一飞到小岛就会联络你 - 好的 小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll contact you when I reach the island. - Be careful, Bond-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.30,0:54:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,基地一号 我正飞过小岛 除了看到渔村以外 没什么可报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Base One. I'm over the island. Have seen the fishing village. Nothing to report.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.68,0:55:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 我们会继续收听\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll keep listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.79,0:55:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,基地一号 这里除了火山没别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Base One. There's nothing here but volcanoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.46,0:55:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白 继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understood. Carry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.48,0:58:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 基地一号 - 我们正在听\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello, Base One. - Listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.02,0:58:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,小娜莉受到热烈的欢迎 四个大汉刚对她进行骚扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little Nellie got a hot reception. Four big-shots made improper advances.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.78,0:58:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她已成功的击退了敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she defended her honor with great success.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.44,0:58:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在正在回家 - 别回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Heading for home. - Do not come home, Bond-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.82,0:58:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏联快要发射太空船 飞往4.6度航线 等待指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Russian space shot imminent. Proceed vector 4-6 degrees and await instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.58,0:58:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白吗？- 收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Understood? - Roger and out.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.78,1:02:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开降落区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear the area. Clear the area.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.91,1:02:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备迎接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare for reception.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.00,1:02:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备迎接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare for reception.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.63,1:02:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷达讯号已经完全中断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Radar blackout is now complete.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.09,1:02:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷达讯号已经完全中断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Radar blackout is now complete.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.86,1:02:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫斯科电台已经说是我们做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moscow radio's already saying that we did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.32,1:02:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统将在下午两点召开新闻发表会 否认此事和我们有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}The president's called a press conference. He'll deny we had anything to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.04,1:03:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但我们可以证明吗？- 当然不可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But can we prove it? - Of course we can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.33,1:03:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有人相信俄国自毁太空船\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world isn't gonna believe the Russians did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.00,1:03:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会藉机击落我们的木星号\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll use the excuse to shoot down our next Jupiter.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.88,1:03:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,休士顿通知华府 我们追踪了它一个轨道 后来它失去了踪影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Houston to Washington. We followed him for one orbit, now he's off the screen.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.05,1:03:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那意味著它正在降落\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means he's coming down.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.43,1:03:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 但在哪里？- 一定是在苏联的某个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, but where? - Some place in Russia. It has to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.18,1:03:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国人说在日本是荒谬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The British theory about Japan is nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.60,1:03:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别提日本了 - 我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Forget Japan. - I agree.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.06,1:03:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们每英寸地方都拍了照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've rephotographed every square inch.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.06,1:04:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,抽气扇全力开动 开启所有空气输送管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ventilator fans to full power. Open all air ducts.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.31,1:04:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以安全进入 所有人员就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Area safe to enter. All crews to stations.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.15,1:04:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有空气输送管回复正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}All air ducts to normal.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.70,1:04:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有空气输送管开启\N{\fnArial\fs30}Air ducts opened.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.41,1:04:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 关闭火山口 - 关闭火山口\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Close crater. - Closing crater.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.74,1:04:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,武装守卫站岗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire guards to stations.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.22,1:04:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,抽气扇回复正常 打开百叶窗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ventilator fans to normal. Open shutters.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.14,1:04:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,迎接完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reception complete.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.01,1:04:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,取出被掳的太空船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Withdraw captive spaceship.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.68,1:04:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,警卫就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guards to stations.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.55,1:05:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 带走犯人 - 带走犯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Remove the prisoners. - Remove the prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.40,1:05:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会在房间里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall be in my apartment.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.24,1:05:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能稍后会找你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may send for you later.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.90,1:06:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你们 你们的仪器很先进\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must congratulate you, gentlemen, upon your superb equipment.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.36,1:06:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也恭喜你们计划成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}We congratulate you, sir, upon the way you handle it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.28,1:06:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的客户至目前为止 仍感满意吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our clients are satisfied with the progress so far?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.32,1:06:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我国政府很满意 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My government is quite satisfied. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.87,1:06:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的食人鱼很饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will see that my piranha fish get very hungry.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.67,1:06:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们能在三十秒内吃掉一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can strip a man to the bone in 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.27,1:07:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你们把一亿元的黄金\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have decided to ask for a little money in advance.I want the sum of 100 million dollars in gold bullion.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.28,1:07:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,存进我在布宜诺斯艾利斯的户口\N{\fnArial\fs30}deposited in our account in Buenos Aires.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.53,1:07:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的协议说好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our agreement states clearly that no money should be paid.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.66,1:07:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,美俄两国开战后才付钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}until war has broken out between Russia and the United States.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.33,1:07:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这简直是勒索 - 勒索是我的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is extortion. - Extortion is my business.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.92,1:07:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们考虑一下吧 我很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go and think it over, gentlemen. I'm busy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.04,1:07:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,大里跟11号马上进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Osato and Number 11, report now.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.85,1:07:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天有位不知名的英国人 到你办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}An unknown Englishman was in your office the other day.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.40,1:07:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Correct, Number One.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.44,1:07:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道这是什么手枪吗？- 华达PPK枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you know what gun this is? - Walther PPK.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.28,1:07:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个人用这种手枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one person we know uses this sort of gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.74,1:08:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.41,1:08:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是邦德已经死了 - 报纸也刊登了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But Bond is dead. - It was in all the newspapers.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.83,1:08:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡说八道 邦德还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rubbish. Bond is alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.42,1:08:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你已杀了他 大里先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you killed him, Mr. Osato?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.84,1:08:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉我你让他逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me you let him go.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.80,1:08:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已下令要11号杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave Number 11 the strictest orders to eliminate him.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.60,1:08:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她有吗？- 她失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And did she? - She failed.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.02,1:08:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该亲自下手 你有很多机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have killed him yourself. You had plenty of opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.48,1:08:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个组织不会容忍失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}This organization does not tolerate failure.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.77,1:08:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道 但… - 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know, but you see… - Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.07,1:08:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不走？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.74,1:08:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaargh!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.00,1:08:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,大里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Osato!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.13,1:08:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上杀了邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill Bond! Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.43,1:09:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 一号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Number One. Yes. Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.18,1:09:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 外太空来的坏消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. - Bad news from outer space.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.85,1:09:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说了 俄国政府正在指责美国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I heard it. Now the Russians are accusing the Americans.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.48,1:09:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 下次便会开战了 - 我们要到火山去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Next time it will be war. - We have to get down to those volcanoes.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.52,1:09:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.02,1:09:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,也需要一流的人手陪同\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll also need a company of first-rate men.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.49,1:10:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在这里有突击队吗？- 我有更好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you have any commandos here? - I have much, much better.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.07,1:10:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是忍者 这是高度机密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ninjas. Top-secret, Bond-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.99,1:10:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的忍者训练学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my ninja training school.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.34,1:10:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 忍者？- 神出鬼没 攻其不备\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ninjas? - The art of concealment and surprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.71,1:10:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可训练出极快的反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}This must develop very fast reflex actions.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.59,1:10:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有意志力\N{\fnArial\fs30}And spiritual strength.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.04,1:11:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在去看现代的忍者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we will see some modern ninjas.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.59,1:11:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的计划是 我在岛上建立基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}My plan is this. I make a base on the Ama island.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.96,1:11:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,一百名忍者会潜入岛上 假扮成工人跟渔夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}100 of my ninjas will slide in unseen. They will be workers and fishermen.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.72,1:11:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我呢？- 待会儿再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about me? - Later.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.72,1:11:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 你应该对这些有兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for the moment, these will interest you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.35,1:11:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,火箭枪 威力强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rocket guns. Very powerful.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.64,1:11:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,后面的小孔是喷射推进\N{\fnArial\fs30}See the little holes in the back for jet propulsion?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.15,1:12:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很不错的枪 - 全都是火箭枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a fine gun. - All rocket guns.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.53,1:12:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是特别的小火箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our special baby rocket.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.49,1:12:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对抽太多烟的人非常有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very useful for people who smoke too many cigarettes, like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.75,1:12:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 三十码内百发百中 - 很精巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Accurate up to 30 yards. - Very neat.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.80,1:12:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这支香烟可以救你一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can save your life, this cigarette.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.13,1:12:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的语气跟广告很像\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sound like a commercial.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.05,1:12:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对我有什么安排？- 首先 你要成为日本人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now, what's the plan for me? - First, you become a Japanese.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.39,1:12:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,其次 你要努力练习成为忍者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second, you train hard and quickly to become a ninja like us.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.81,1:12:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后 为了掩人耳目 你要娶老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And third, to give you extra-special cover, you take a wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.12,1:12:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,很可惜 不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regretfully impossible.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.49,1:12:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要娶一个当地的海女\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must marry Ama girl. One who is known on the island.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.37,1:13:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她漂亮吗？- 她跟母猪一样丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is she pretty? - She has a face like a pig.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.50,1:13:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去你的鬼主意 - 但这是职责所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To hell with that idea. - But this is duty.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.38,1:13:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所选的女子是我的情报员 但首先 你要成为日本人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl I have chosen is an agent of mine. But first, you must become Japanese.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.99,1:13:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何不是只染外露的部位？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you just dye the parts that show?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.54,1:13:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚上好 - 晚上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Konbanwa. - Konbanwa.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.21,1:13:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,老虎说 从现在开始 你要做事日本化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tiger said, from now on, you must do everything Japanese-style.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.64,1:13:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.26,1:13:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,老虎真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good for Tiger.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.18,1:16:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.56,1:16:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.02,1:16:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明子 - 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aki. - I'm…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.87,1:16:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.04,1:16:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,被毒死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poisoned.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.63,1:16:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,老虎 我们必须到岛上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tiger, we must get to that island.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.42,1:16:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没准备好 再多等两天\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're almost ready. Just two more days' training.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.38,1:17:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你杀了他 - 他想杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You killed him. - Yeah, he tried to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.51,1:17:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个是外来的陌生人 - 我们能离开这里真的很幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This man is a stranger from outside. - It's lucky we're getting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.81,1:17:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天你将变成卑微的日本工人 有个谦恭的日本太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow you will be a poor Japanese worker with a humble Japanese wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.52,1:17:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 她跟母猪一样丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, with a face like a pig.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.45,1:21:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的手下已在岛上 遍布全岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}My men are already ashore, all over the island.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.41,1:21:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只剩四天 没有多少时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have four days left. It is not much time.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.68,1:22:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my house.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.35,1:22:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友已帮我们准备了食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend has made us some food.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.86,1:22:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你独自住在这里？- 是的 我的父母都去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you live here alone? - Yes. My parents are dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.20,1:22:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.29,1:22:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,生蠔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oysters.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.54,1:22:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里只有一个房间是的 - 那是你的床\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is this the only room there is? - Yes. That is your bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.92,1:22:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我睡在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall sleep over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.59,1:22:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're supposed to be married.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.55,1:22:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,请想清楚 你给祭司的名字是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think again, please. You gave false name to priest.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.01,1:22:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 但是我们要逼真点 我们正在度蜜月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but we must keep up appearances. We're on our honeymoon.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.35,1:22:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有蜜月 这是任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}No honeymoon. This is business.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.15,1:23:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我不需要这些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I won't need these.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.18,1:23:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 邦德？- 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bond-san? - What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.51,1:23:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国人改变了发射日期 他们已开始倒数\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Americans changed the launching date. The countdown has already started.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.56,1:23:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统已在电视上 对俄国提出最后警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}The president has given a last warning to the Russians.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.77,1:23:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它何时会发射？- 日本时间 今天半夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When does it go up? - Tonight. Midnight, our time.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.53,1:23:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的手下有搜查全岛了吗？- 没有任何线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did your men search the island? - Yes. There is nothing except volcanoes.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.86,1:23:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了火山以外一切都很正常 没事发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is so normal around here. Nothing happens.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.91,1:24:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了一件奇怪的事 昨天一个海女划船进入龟头峡\N{\fnArial\fs30}One thing has happened. Yesterday an Ama girl rowed her boat into Ryuzaki.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.25,1:24:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 龟头峡？- 那是在本土的一个大山洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ryuzaki? - It is a big cave on the mainland.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.46,1:24:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,当她的船再漂出来时 她已死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when her boat floated out again, she was dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.34,1:24:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是我们昨天看到的丧礼？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Was that the funeral we saw yesterday? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.55,1:24:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她怎么死的？- 没人知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How did she die? - Nobody knows.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.76,1:24:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能带我去山洞吗？- 可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you take me to this cave? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.93,1:24:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上我们可以从捕鱼队伍中溜走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll slip away from the fishing fleet in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.14,1:25:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.52,1:25:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,山洞在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, where is this cave?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.06,1:25:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在前面 山洞在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's straight across. The cave is over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.05,1:25:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒气 快到另一边去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gas. Get over the side, quick!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.04,1:26:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,用毒气来避免陌生人进入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phosgene gas, to keep the visitors away.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.17,1:26:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有注意到墙上的硫磺吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you notice the sulfur on the walls?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.76,1:26:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 黄色的部分？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The yellow? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.22,1:26:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那曾是熔岩的地下出口\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was once an underground outlet for the lava from the volcano.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.59,1:26:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那里一定有很长的隧道 - 有好几里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There must be a long tunnel. - Miles of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.39,1:26:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直通往上面 直到山顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}It leads all the way, right up to the top there.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.48,1:26:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须到山上去 你可以吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where we have to go. Can you make it?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.90,1:26:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然可以 这是任务 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course. It's business. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.63,1:26:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以休息一下吗？- 可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- May I rest a moment? - Surely.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.01,1:27:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很辛苦 - 好一个蜜月\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's hard work. - Mm. Some honeymoon.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.21,1:27:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,它飞进了火山里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going down, into the volcano.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.93,1:27:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,直升机回基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heliport to position.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.93,1:27:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜜月结束了 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The honeymoon's over. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.30,1:28:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是死火山吧？- 一直都是 在我这辈子都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This volcano isn't active, is it? - It never has been. Not in my lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.77,1:28:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近这里非常炽热\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's been some terrific heat here recently.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.56,1:28:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那直升机怎么了？- 在下边某个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened to the helicopter? - It's down there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.73,1:28:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.07,1:28:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备 开始十秒倒数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by. Mark. Stand by for ten-second countdown.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.57,1:28:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,十 九 八…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten, nine, eight…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.24,1:28:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,太空船进入轨道后所有单位都进入戒备状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}All units throughout the world will remain at readiness so long as we're in orbit.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.54,1:28:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,三 二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}…three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.54,1:29:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ignition.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.31,1:29:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们只能等候和祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it, gentlemen. All we can do now is wait and pray.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.62,1:29:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里很深吗？- 通常是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that deep? - They usually are. Very.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.13,1:29:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是金属的！待在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's metal! Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.86,1:30:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,直升机准备起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heliport to takeoff position.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.99,1:30:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开火山口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open crater.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.22,1:30:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急人员就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emergency crews to stations.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.14,1:30:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去通知田中带所有人来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back to Tanaka. Tell him to bring every man he's got.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.90,1:30:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.06,1:31:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,关闭直升机升降台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heliport to standby position.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.64,1:32:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,太空人到更衣室…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Astronauts to dressing rooms. Astronauts to dressing rooms.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.78,1:32:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意 美国目标太空船已在轨道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention. Attention. American target vehicle is now in orbit.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.87,1:32:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,两小时后进行截击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interception will take place in two hours' time.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.47,1:32:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,华府 这里是休士顿 休士顿呼叫华府\N{\fnArial\fs30}Washington, this is Houston. Houston to Washington.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.98,1:32:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,太空船现在的高度是120海里 航行距离是170英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our vehicle is now 120 nautical miles altitude, 170 miles downrange.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.45,1:32:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,木星呼叫休士顿 现在进入第二阶段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jupiter to Houston, we now have second phase.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.20,1:33:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 木星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger, Jupiter.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.62,1:33:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,太空船已起飞了四小时三十六分\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are four hours plus 36 minutes into the mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.46,1:33:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可否报告时间？- 收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you give us a time? - Roger.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.42,1:33:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,连接点火装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connect igniter cable.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.26,1:33:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,连接点火装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connect igniter cable.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.29,1:33:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷达技术人员到控制室报到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Radar technicians, report to control room.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.92,1:33:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷达技术人员到控制室报到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Radar technicians, report to control room.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.81,1:34:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,一百分钟后发射 正在倒数\N{\fnArial\fs30}T minus 100 minutes and counting.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.82,1:34:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是自愿参加太空人训练的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you volunteer for astronaut training?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.82,1:34:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我国 我们叫做宇宙飞行员 是的 我们两个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}In our country, we say "cosmonaut". Yes, both of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.03,1:34:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们受训了六个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since six months we started training.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.12,1:34:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.25,1:34:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁？- 退后 我要炸开门锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who the hell are you? - Stand back, I'm gonna blow the lock.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.05,1:34:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand back.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.69,1:34:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿上他们的制服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get into their uniforms.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.21,1:35:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,太空人有两分钟时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Astronauts have two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.67,1:36:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复 两分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeat, two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.56,1:36:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,后备太空人准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reserve astronaut to stand by.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.23,1:36:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瞄准目标太空船 - 瞄准目标太空船\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lock on target. - Lock on target vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.86,1:36:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查辅助导航系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check secondary guidance.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.11,1:36:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,19分钟后发射 正在倒数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Launch time is now T minus 90 minutes and counting.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.53,1:36:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,太空人请到发射台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Astronauts to launching pad.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.16,1:36:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,太空人请到发射台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Astronauts to launching pad.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.41,1:36:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复 太空人立刻到发射台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeat, astronauts to launching pad immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.87,1:37:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作人员到平台上准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crews, stand by on gantry. Crews, stand by on gantry.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.00,1:37:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 制止那个太空人 带他来见我 - 制止那个太空人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop that astronaut. Bring him to me. - Stop that astronaut!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.04,1:38:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 后备太空人请到发射台 - 后备太空人立刻到发射台\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Summon the reserve astronaut. - Reserve astronaut to launching pad.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.67,1:38:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新瞄准目标太空船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reserve astronaut to launching pad immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.06,1:38:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,电脑刚刚收到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Re-coordinate with target vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.39,1:38:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标太空船的最新资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}A new update with target vehicle has been received from computers.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.53,1:38:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,七分钟后发射 正在倒数\N{\fnArial\fs30}We now have T minus seven minutes and counting.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.95,1:38:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做错了 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made a mistake, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.99,1:38:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有太空人会拿著空调机 进入太空舱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No astronaut would enter the capsule carrying his air conditioner.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.16,1:38:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱下他的头盔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remove his helmet.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.71,1:38:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯邦德 让我自我介绍\N{\fnArial\fs30}James Bond. Allow me to introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.93,1:38:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是恩斯特布露菲尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Ernst Stavro Blofeld.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.06,1:38:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说你在香港被刺杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}They told me you were assassinated in Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.06,1:39:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 这是我的第二条命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, this is my second life.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.77,1:39:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只能活两次 邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}You only live twice, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.19,1:39:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标太空船正在俄国中部的上空 一直飞向蒙古\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target vehicle passing over central Russia. Approaching Mongolia.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.24,1:39:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,轨道跟预期一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Track is as predicted.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.11,1:39:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我快要发动一场小型战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you see, I am about to inaugurate a little war.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.58,1:39:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,数小时后 美国跟俄国将会互相摧毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a matter of hours, when America and Russia have annihilated each other,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.25,1:39:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球将会由新的势力来统治\N{\fnArial\fs30}we shall see a new power dominating the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.13,1:39:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 目标太空船已进入范围 - 重新检查目标太空船\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Target vehicle on scope. - Brief check on target vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.51,1:39:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱掉他的太空衣 搜他的身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remove his suit and search him.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.26,1:39:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,后备太空人已经准备妥当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reserve astronaut ready on Bird 1.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.56,1:39:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备发射 - 准备发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Prepare for firing. - Prepare for firing.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.23,1:39:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人离开发射区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear the area.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.53,1:39:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人离开发射区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear the area.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.07,1:39:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急人员准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emergency services to stand by.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.58,1:39:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人已经离开发射区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Area now clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.45,1:40:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,一分三十秒后发射 正在倒数\N{\fnArial\fs30}T minus one minute 30 seconds and counting.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.50,1:40:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新瞄准目标太空船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Re-coordinate with target vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.42,1:40:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞鸟一号准备妥当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bird 1 now in readiness.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.22,1:40:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,太空人也准备妥当 所有系统运作正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Astronauts ready on Bird. All systems are go.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.51,1:40:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 关上百叶窗 - 关上百叶窗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Close shutters. - Close shutters.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.97,1:40:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开始中断雷达讯号 - 中断雷达讯号\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Radar blackout commence. - Radar blackout in operation.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.56,1:40:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有效范围八百公里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Effective range, kilometers 800.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.36,1:40:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打开火山口 - 打开火山口\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Open crater. - Opening crater.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.07,1:40:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,火山口正在打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crater opening.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.78,1:40:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞鸟一号准备起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bird 1 to liftoff position.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.22,1:41:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,开动引擎 打开压力箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gimbal the engines. Pressurized tanks open.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.85,1:41:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,抽气扇全力开动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ventilator fans to full power.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.98,1:41:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,十秒 九 八\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten seconds. Nine. Eight.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.27,1:41:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,七 六 五 四\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven. Six. Five. Four.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.19,1:41:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,三 二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three. Two. One.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.32,1:41:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,零 开动引擎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zero. Ignition.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.18,1:41:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 关闭火山口 - 正在关闭火山口\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Close crater. - Closing crater.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.23,1:41:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开百叶窗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open shutters.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.77,1:42:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞鸟一号呼叫基地 火箭分离成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bird 1 to base. Separation complete. Confirm acquisition.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.03,1:42:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫飞鸟一号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calling Bird 1.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.41,1:42:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在已飞行了七十海里 高度为二百英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are 70 nautical miles downrange, 200 miles altitude.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.99,1:42:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的工作很快就完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hans, our job will soon be done.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.54,1:42:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一抓到美国人就引爆太空船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blow them up as soon as they have captured the Americans.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.96,1:42:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是开启爆炸装置的钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here is the key to operate the exploder button.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.05,1:42:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人进入火山口\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are men in the crater. Men in the crater.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.38,1:43:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发射火山口的机关枪 - 发射火山口的机关枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Crater guns, fire. - Crater guns, open fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.83,1:43:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,火山口的火力足够歼灭一队军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}The firing power inside my crater is enough to annihilate a small army.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.33,1:43:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能从荧幕上看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can watch it all on TV.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.71,1:43:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可能是你看到的最后一个节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the last program you're likely to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.92,1:43:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你非得逼我看电视 我能抽烟吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'm going to be forced to watch television, may I smoke?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.63,1:43:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以 把他的香烟给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Give him his cigarettes.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.89,1:43:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会是死于尼古丁的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't be the nicotine that kills you, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.37,1:44:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,武装警卫到控制室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Armed guards to control room.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.34,1:44:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 关闭火山口 - 关闭火山口\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Close the crater. - Close crater.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.76,1:44:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我个人很期望杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall look forward personally to exterminating you, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.24,1:45:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,关闭百叶窗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close the shutters.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.00,1:45:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是攻不破的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are now impregnable.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.17,1:45:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,八分钟后进行截击 没人可以阻止我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interception will take place in eight minutes. Nothing can prevent that.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.18,1:47:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻不破的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impregnable?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.18,1:47:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟我来 邦德先生 - 飞鸟一号呼叫基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come with me, Mr. Bond. - Bird 1 to base. Locked on target.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.64,1:47:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瞄准目标 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Osato? - Yes, Number One.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.02,1:47:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,基地呼叫飞鸟一号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Base calling Bird 1.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.65,1:47:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在起 你们得负起责任 全力完成行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are to assume full control of operation from now on.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.32,1:47:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 七分钟后 开始截击太空船 - 收到 基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Seven minutes to interception. - Roger, Base One.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.99,1:47:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏威夷呼叫休士顿 观测器上出现不明物体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Houston, this is Hawaii. We have an unidentified object on scope.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.08,1:47:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一级警戒信号 所有武器准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Order first alert. Arm all weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.95,1:47:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,六分钟后开始截击行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interception will occur in six minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.13,1:47:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是失败者必须付出的代价 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the price of failure, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.22,1:47:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.61,1:48:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 邦德先生！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, Mr. Bond!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.21,1:48:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制室有个引爆装置 我们必须上去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an exploder button up in the control room. We've gotta get up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.63,1:48:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能 他们防守的太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impossible. Too well defended.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.43,1:48:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤退控制室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evacuate the control. Evacuate the control.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.41,1:49:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制室的技术人员 一定有其他的路可以上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Control room technicians. There must be another way up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.42,1:49:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,掩护我上阶梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me cover till I get to the staircase.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.78,1:50:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaargh!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.82,1:51:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,用餐愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bon appit.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.51,1:51:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,渐渐接近我们的太空船 一样的轨道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Closing fast on our vehicle. Orbit identical.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.01,1:51:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人员待命 行动代号是「紧急」\N{\fnArial\fs30}All units stand by for codeword. Codeword is imminent.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.60,1:51:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复 渐渐接近我们的太空船\N{\fnArial\fs30}I repeat, closing fast on our vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.76,1:52:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人爆炸了！重复 敌人已爆炸了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's blown up! The enemy! I repeat, the enemy has blown up!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.26,1:52:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有单位回到一级警戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}All units will return to first alert.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.89,1:52:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,代号是「不紧急」 我重复「不紧急」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Codeword is "not", I say again, "not imminent".
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.56,1:52:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tiger, we've done it.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.50,1:52:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down the tunnel!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.59,1:54:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳著点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.89,1:54:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于我们的蜜月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, er… about that honeymoon.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.73,1:54:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不继续？但他们不会让你留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not? But they'll never let you stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.32,1:54:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会找到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they'll never find us.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.93,1:54:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已登船了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dinghy's on board, sir.Tell him to come below and report.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.69,1:54:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,会很愉快的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be a pleasure, sir.
